      "keyframePrompt": "16:9 widescreen cinema frame (2021进博会《上海的邀请》). Shot on ARRI Alexa Mini LF / Phantom Flex4K with Laowa 24mm Probe & ZEISS 85mm APO at T1.8 / T8.0. Film Stock: ZEISS T* Natural HDR & Cupertino Clean LUT. Lighting: 6:1 液态渐变柔光条轮廓光, 5800K 钛金属冷光对撞 3500K 琥珀流光. Extracted Master Palette: Deep Tone(#515E64) / Primary Mass(#3F3940) / Center Focus(#8F9CA0) / Secondary Accent(#92A2A5) / Rim Highlight(#9FB5B4). Parted lips (2mm), eyes 15 degrees off-camera, authentic skin pores and physical material micro-texture.",
      "seedancePrompt": "【空间与机位光学】：16:9 · Laowa 24mm Probe & ZEISS 85mm APO · T1.8 / T8.0 · 6:1 液态渐变柔光条轮廓光 · 实测母片色板 Deep Tone(#515E64) / Primary Mass(#3F3940) / Center Focus(#8F9CA0) / Secondary Accent(#92A2A5) / Rim Highlight(#9FB5B4)\n【角色与动作因果时序】：\n  [0-0.4s] 首帧人物双唇微启2~3mm，眼神偏角15度锁定目标；\n  [0.4-5.0s] 摄影机执行【Bolt 机械臂贴面滑行 + 穿镜微距 (Needle Zoom)】，主体完成连续物理受力动作；\n  [5.0-7.5s] 动作收束，保留整整2.5秒冷峻死寂落幅。\n【台词发音与拼音死锁】：字正腔圆，严禁吞音！\n【纯净音轨与声学空间混响】：Zero BGM！Zero 环境底噪！仅保留纯净角色对白与场景自然物理声学混响！\n【绝对物理负向禁令】：100% Deadpan！严禁假笑！严禁斗鸡眼！严禁直视镜头！"
